WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.231 line:82%
Chapter 6. Teach with smart lesson plans, with games ready to start.

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:10.491 line:82%
After Test 1, open "Results" and click the test.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:18.571 line:82%
Press "Lesson plan", then "Make lesson plan". The app plans a 55-minute lesson for this class.

00:00:19.035 --> 00:00:26.991 line:82%
The plan uses everything the app knows: this Test 1, old weak points, the words sent home, and each student's scores.

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:35.253 line:82%
The shape fits the class. A weak class gets more guided practice. A strong class gets more speaking and challenge.

00:00:35.704 --> 00:00:39.712 line:82%
Each activity says why it is there, from your class data.

00:00:40.164 --> 00:00:47.432 line:82%
Stages with the app have a Start button. The game opens with this lesson's questions and this class, ready.

00:00:47.886 --> 00:00:54.811 line:82%
The plan ends with an exit check: three questions on the phones, so you see at once if the lesson worked.

00:00:55.262 --> 00:01:01.251 line:82%
Each stage tells you what to say, what to write on the board, and what to show on the projector.

00:01:01.711 --> 00:01:06.732 line:82%
Not happy with an activity? Press "Other activity" to get a different one.

00:01:07.188 --> 00:01:16.231 line:82%
Press "Edit" to change anything. Show the plan on the projector, print it, or download it as a Word file or PowerPoint slides.

00:01:16.689 --> 00:01:22.292 line:82%
At the bottom: the students who need help, peer buddies, and homework for each group.

00:01:22.759 --> 00:01:29.052 line:82%
In class, you don't need to open the plan. On Home, the plan is there with its Start buttons.

00:01:29.507 --> 00:01:31.971 line:82%
Press Start for the exit check.

00:01:33.063 --> 00:01:37.350 line:82%
The game is ready. The phones join, and you just press Start.

00:01:37.816 --> 00:01:44.230 line:82%
Fewer phones, a big class, or the last hour of the day? The plan changes its games for you.
